Memento modification notice

This patch changes Linux KVM to record guest RDRAND and RDSEED results.
The Memento changes were made on 2026-09-30, 2026-10-06, and 2026-10-15.
The SPDX identifiers inside the patched Linux files follow the Linux kernel's
GPL-2.0-only licensing convention.

